# 45) M38 运行时错误报告：未捕获异常 → "vuna: runtime error: ..." + vuna 位置帧 + exit 2。
#     `.err` 的既有断言（片段 "division by zero"）仍成立；这里额外锁定新格式，
#     并确认不再泄漏 OCaml 的 `Fatal error: exception ...`。纯 main（模块初始化期求值）
#     与动作 main（main 钩子执行期）两条路径都覆盖。
run: sh -c 'mkdir -p "$TMPDIR/m38-rt/app"; printf "[package]\nname = \"m38-rt\"\nprivileged = true\n\n[dependencies]\nvuna-base = \"%s\"\n" "$VUNA_BASE" >"$TMPDIR/m38-rt/vuna.toml"; printf "main : Int\nmain = 10 / 0\n" >"$TMPDIR/m38-rt/app/Main.vuna"'
run: "$VUNA" build "$TMPDIR/m38-rt" 2>&1
run: "$TMPDIR/m38-rt/.output/bin/m38-rt" 2>&1
exit: 2
out-contains: vuna: runtime error: division by zero
out-contains:   at main (
out-contains: app/Main.vuna:
out-not-contains: Fatal error
run: sh -c 'printf "import Base.Host\n\nmain : Eff [] Int\nmain = do\n  println \"m38-start\"\n  exit (10 / 0)\n" >"$TMPDIR/m38-rt/app/Main.vuna"'
run: "$VUNA" build "$TMPDIR/m38-rt" 2>&1
run: "$TMPDIR/m38-rt/.output/bin/m38-rt" 2>&1
exit: 2
out-contains: m38-start
out-contains:   at main (